@tutor48Token = <PEGAR_TOKEN_TUTOR_48>

@tutor47 = 47
@tutor48 = 48

### ========================================
### TUTORS - REGLA CLAVE
### Un JWT de tutor solo accede a su propio tutorId
### ========================================

### [OK] Perfil del tutor autenticado (tutor 47)
GET {{host}}/tutors
Authorization: Bearer {{tutor47Token}}
Accept: application/json

### [OK] Tutor 47 consulta su id
GET {{host}}/tutors/{{tutor47}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tutor47Token}}
Accept: application/json

### [FORBIDDEN esperado] Tutor 47 no puede consultar tutor 48
GET {{host}}/tutors/{{tutor48}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tutor47Token}}
Accept: application/json

### [OK] Tutor 47: ver sus estudiantes
GET {{host}}/tutors/{{tutor47}}/students
Authorization: Bearer {{tutor47Token}}
Accept: application/json

### [FORBIDDEN esperado] Tutor 47 no puede ver alumnos de tutor 48
GET {{host}}/tutors/{{tutor48}}/students
Authorization: Bearer {{tutor47Token}}
Accept: application/json

### ========================================
### CRUD TECNICO (usar con cuidado)
### Nota: para login funcional, registrar por Auth Service
### ========================================

### POST /tutors (crea tutor directo en microservicio)
POST {{host}}/tutors
Authorization: Bearer {{tutor47Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Carlos Ramirez",
  "email": "carlos.gabriel@example.com",
  "passwordHash": "TutorPass123",
  "country": "CO",
  "gender": "M",
  "age": 35,
  "degree": "Maestria"
}

### PUT /tutors/{id}
PUT {{host}}/tutors/{{tutor47}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tutor47Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Juan Garcia",
  "email": "juan.garcia@mail.com",
  "country": "MX",
  "gender": "M",
  "age": 35,
  "grade": "Maestria"
}

### Assign student by email (JWT tutor debe coincidir con tutorEmail)
POST {{host}}/tutors/assign-student
Authorization: Bearer {{tutor47Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentEmail": "student.demo@mail.com",
  "tutorEmail": "juan.garcia@mail.com"
}

### [FORBIDDEN esperado] tutor47 intentando asignar con email de tutor48
POST {{host}}/tutors/assign-student
Authorization: Bearer {{tutor47Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentEmail": "student.demo@mail.com",
  "tutorEmail": "maria.lopez@mail.com"
}

### DELETE /tutors/{id}
### CUIDADO: rompe relacion con students y potencialmente flujo funcional
DELETE {{host}}/tutors/{{tutor47}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tutor47Token}}
Accept: application/json
